Docker-first workflow (Windows PowerShell)

URLs
- Odoo: http://127.0.0.1:8888
- Backend: http://127.0.0.1:9000

1) Start containers
docker compose up -d

2) Start chatbot backend (host terminal)
uvicorn chatbot_backend.main:app --reload --host 127.0.0.1 --port 9000

3) Update chatbot module in Docker Odoo (copy-paste this as one line)
docker compose exec odoo odoo -d odoo19_dev -u ai_chatbot --stop-after-init --db_host=db --db_port=5432 --db_user=odoo --db_password=odoo

4) Restart Odoo container to serve rebuilt assets
docker compose restart odoo

5) Verify running services
docker compose ps

6) Browser refresh for frontend assets
Open: http://127.0.0.1:8888/web?debug=assets
Then hard refresh: Ctrl+F5

One-shot update cycle (copy-paste this whole block)
docker compose up -d
docker compose exec odoo odoo -d odoo19_dev -u ai_chatbot --stop-after-init --db_host=db --db_port=5432 --db_user=odoo --db_password=odoo
docker compose restart odoo
docker compose ps

Optional check: show current chatbot title from source
Get-Content .\custom_addons\ai_chatbot\static\src\js\chatbot_init.js | Select-String "botName"



